{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_1027f64b7688f394-1244\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>劉穎鏇近日在社交平台大晒一組風格唯美的寫真靚相，當中一張她大擺高難度 Pose 的照片，更是將其招牌逆天長腿展露無遺，吸引大批網民圍觀！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_1027f64b7688f394-1245\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中可見，劉穎鏇身穿一襲咖啡色與米白色幾何圖案的針織短款背心及同款熱褲，整體造型簡約隨性又充滿夏日陽光氣息。短款背心完美襯托出其纖細腰身與優美肩頸線條，而熱褲剪裁更將其修長美腿一覽無遺！她置身於充滿現代設計感的建築與石階之中打卡，散發出濃濃的女神氣場。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_1027f64b7688f394-1245\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"339e87af-2d2b-49a0-b5bd-56c704d4b986.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026KVkJeQJXZz1790136982.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"339e87af-2d2b-49a0-b5bd-56c704d4b986.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"56a4a388-f05d-4a33-b463-237c350b3724.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ukJvHle5qu1790136982.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"56a4a388-f05d-4a33-b463-237c350b3724.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_1027f64b7688f394-1246\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>而全輯照片中最引人矚目的，莫過於其中一張由高角度拍攝的視覺寫真。相中劉穎鏇全身斜躺在流線型的巨型弧形座椅上，一隻手輕扶頭部，雙腿順著曲面自然延伸至下方石階。這個極具視覺衝擊力的高難度 Pose，將其標誌性的逆天長腿比例無限拉長！不少網民看完紛紛大讚好靚女，並熱烈留言：「長腿女神名不虛傳」、「對腳短啲都影唔到！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_1027f64b7688f394-1247\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>劉穎鏇隨圖附上英文感性留言，為正在忙碌奮鬥的粉絲送上溫馨鼓勵：「even on the busiest days, don’t forget to pause, sit back, and catch your breath! you’re doing great, btw 🤎🩵」（即使在最忙碌的日子裡，也不要忘記停下來、坐好並喘一口氣！順帶一提，你做得很好</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T04:58:55.434153+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":533,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}